          "default": null,
          "description": "The best objective a solution a BranchAndBound run had not ruled out could reach, on best_objective's scale: best_objective once proven optimal, and how far from the optimum the run may have stopped otherwise. Null for every other heuristic, and when the run stopped before it had a finite bound.",
